# Placeholder for CHECKSUMS.sha256
# This file is auto-generated by the release workflow on every tag.
# It contains SHA256 checksums for all files in the release, signed with GPG and Cosign.
# Between releases, a placeholder is kept in the repository.
# Always verify the signed CHECKSUMS.sha256 from the GitHub Releases page.
#
# Example format (not actual checksums):
# PROJECT.md: e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855
# SKILL.md: e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855
# ... (and so on for every file)
#
# This file is not meant to be manually edited.